<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:%E8%8B%B1%E8%AA%9E%E7%99%BC%E9%9F%B3\" title=\"Appendix:英语发音\">帮助</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">/bʉk/</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"homophones\"><a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:%E8%A1%93%E8%AA%9E%E8%A1%A8#同音詞\" title=\"Appendix:术语表\">同音词</a>：<span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/buck#英語\" title=\"buck\">buck</a></span> <span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Phonological_history_of_English_close_back_vowels#FOOT–STRUT_split\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Phonological history of English close back vowels\">无<i>foot</i>-<i>strut</i>分裂</a>, when pronounced /bʊk/</span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span></span></li>\n<li>韵部：<a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Rhymes:%E8%8B%B1%E8%AA%9E/%CA%8Ak&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Rhymes:英语/ʊk（页面不存在）\"><span class=\"IPA nowrap\">-ʊk</span></a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"名詞\"><span id=\".E5.90.8D.E8.A9.9E\"></span>名词</h3></div>\n<p><span class=\"headword-line\"><strong class=\"Latn headword\" lang=\"en\">book</strong> (复数 <b class=\"Latn form-of lang-en p-form-of\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/books#英語\" title=\"books\">books</a></b>)</span>\n</p>\n<ol><li><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9B%B8\" title=\"书\">书</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC\" title=\"书本\">书本</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9B%B8%E7%B1%8D\" title=\"书籍\">书籍</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%B7\" title=\"卷\">卷</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B0%BF\" title=\"簿\">簿</a></li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"動詞\"><span id=\".E5.8B.95.E8.A9.9E\"></span>动词</h3></div>\n<p><span class=\"headword-line\"><strong class=\"Latn headword\" lang=\"en\">book</strong> (第三人称单数简单现在时 <b class=\"Latn form-of lang-en s-verb-form-form-of\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/books#英語\" title=\"books\">books</a></b>，现在分词 <b class=\"Latn form-of lang-en ing-form-form-of\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/booking#英語\" title=\"booking\">booking</a></b>，简单过去时和过去分词 <b class=\"Latn form-of lang-en ed-form-form-of\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=booked&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"booked（页面不存在）\">booked</a></b>)</span>\n</p>\n<ol><li>登记, 预订, 控告</li></ol>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐web.eqiad.main‐75d67bc6d9‐6f7br\nCached time: 20261004151700\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, prevent‐selective‐update, show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.354 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.534 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 224/1000000\nRevision size: 501/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 13578/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3961/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 909/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.270/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 12001892/104857600 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  465.100      1 -total\n 76.97%  357.970      5 Template:No_deprecated_lang_param_usage\n 68.11%  316.761      3 Template:IPA\n 10.38%   48.264      1 Template:En-noun\n  9.70%   45.112      2 Template:Audio\n  6.89%   32.037      2 Template:Check_deprecated_lang_param_usage\n  6.56%   30.497      2 Template:Deprecated_code\n  5.80%   26.961      1 Template:Homophones\n  2.27%   10.547      1 Template:En-verb\n  1.70%    7.891      1 Template:Rhymes\n-->\n\n<!-- Render ID a54083c6-c006-11f1-b631-ff3ce80929a1 -->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key zhwiktionary:pcache:42705:|#|:idhash:canonical!zh-hans and timestamp 20261004151700 and revision id 9744765. Rendering was triggered because: page_view\n -->\n</div>"
